":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202410/mobi094UU.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日が来なければいいのにって日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この質問を投げかけられた時答えはあるのに\nはぐらかした自分がいて。きっと容易に聞くものでは無いんだなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラスサビの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明日は 明日は 誰かのために」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が嫌な明日も誰かにとっては待ちに待った明日なのかもしれないし。私が来て欲しい明日は、誰かにとっては来て欲しくない明日なのかもしれないと思うと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少し。\n来て欲しい明日を待ってみてもいいかなって   少しーだけ伝えたくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも。今は明日が待ち遠しいよ~"}],"source":"official"}}